gh $42M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 1.6\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 6.9% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (15.5% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Carries a 177% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":1.7733383685800606},{"text":"Heavy insider selling (net $34.0M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-34010399.5},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Industrials peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Industrials sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 6% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclicality and capital intensity \u2014 order books turn on a dime, and the heavy fixed cost base that creates the moat also magnifies the downturn.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Supply chain reshoring costs and labour shortages \u2014 onshoring mandates raise capex requirements while a shrinking skilled-labour pool inflates operating costs.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Reinvestment rate supports 11% organic growth capacity \u2014 capital is compounding inside the business","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Growing faster than most Industrials peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Karman Holdings (KRMN) Stock Looks Overvalued Against Its Earnings Story","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/capital-goods/nyse-krmn/karman-holdings/news/karman-holdings-krmn-stock-looks-overvalued-against-its-earn","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794472380.369,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.599,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Karman Holdings (KRMN) Earnings And Deal Plans Put Valuation Back In Focus","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/capital-goods/nyse-krmn/karman-holdings/news/karman-holdings-krmn-earnings-and-deal-plans-put-valuation-b","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794381786.356,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.859,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Karman Space & Defense (NYSE:KRMN) Q3: Record Results","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/industrial/karman-space-defense-nysekrmn-q3-record-results","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794323580.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.758,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Oregon Public Employees Retirement Fund Buys New Position in Karman Holdings Inc. $KRMN","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/10/oregon-public-employees-retirement-fund-buys-new-position-in-karman-holdings-inc-krmn.html","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794303907.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.872,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Surging Earnings Estimates Signal Upside for Karman Holdings Inc. (KRMN) Stock","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3026662/surging-earnings-estimates-signal-upside-for-karman-holdings-inc-krmn-stock?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cyseop_template_8-3026662","date":"2026-